, you\u2019ll utilise stealth tactics to avoid death amongst a cult of sound-based AI enemies.\n\nSet in 1898 and inspired by the haunting Welsh tale of Elisabeth Williams, this is a story of a family empire driven by torture, slavery, piracy and a supernatural mystery that suffocates the grounds of the hotel.\n\n", "short_description": "Maid of Sker VR is a first-person survival horror, set in a remote hotel with a gory and macabre history from Welsh folklore. Brave the nightmares of the Quiet Ones. Do not panic\u2026don\u2019t even breathe!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.walesinteractive.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wales Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://www.walesinteractive.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.walesinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24360297056899861"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1277000627093530"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "932210442864846"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1238365241731586"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1341244507507470"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1238365241731586"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779123600, "st